+     * On entry state0 is r3:r2:r1:r0, state1 is stuff:stuff:r5:r4
+     * and xword is stuff:stuff:X:stuff with X = rot( sub( r3 ) ) ^ RCON
+     * (obtained with AESKEYGENASSIST).
